DESCRIPTION:From conferences to symposiums to poster sessions\, abstracts 
 and research posters are an important part of sharing your work with the 
 academic community. Join the Undergraduate Research Support Office to lea
 rn about how to both write an abstract and create an effective research p
 oster to successfully communicate your findings and deliver an impactful 
 poster presentation.
