DESCRIPTION:You're invited to the final showcase for the 2026 Arts+ and Do
 c+ summer programs.\n\n****\n2-2:45 p.m.: Presentations in the CDS Audito
 rium\n2:45-4 p.m.: Open house across CDS buildings featuring gallery exhi
 bitions\, installations\, and interactive artwork + a catered reception b
 y Med Deli\n****\n\nOver the past six weeks\, Arts+ and Doc+ students hav
 e worked in small teams alongside local arts organizations and industry p
 rofessionals to bring eight community-oriented projects to life. By lever
 aging new skills in documentary production\, archival research\, data vis
 ualization\, podcasting\, and oral history\, along with craft skills in s
 tained glass\, quilting\, and printmaking\, students have supported our c
 reative partners in addressing pressing societal issues and contributing 
 to the vibrant arts community at Duke and in Durham. \n \nStudents in bot
 h programs represent a wide range of disciplines and perspectives. Throug
 hout the summer\, they've collaborated closely with Duke faculty and staf
 f\, professional artists\, and community partners to realize creative vis
 ions and make a positive impact throughout Durham and the American South.
  We look forward to celebrating their work with you.\n\nPlease RSVP: http
 s://airtable.com/appTJnGzNYERAtIjN/pagFSGHAJlFQJi7Mo/form
DURATION:PT2H
